    given-names: Vijay
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-09-19"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/vijaykumarjob0701/rql-lang"
url: "https://github.com/vijaykumarjob0701/rql-rag-query-language"
abstract: >-
  Portable Retrieval Query Language (RQL) library for RAG retrieval plans
  (Python and TypeScript). Parses RQL text, compiles a logical plan to a
  vendor-capability physical plan, explains that plan, and emits vendor-request
  sketches. This is not a vector database; adapters target existing engines
  such as Qdrant, Elasticsearch, and pgvector. On the v0.1.0 tree, emit returns
  documentation-shaped sketches (notExecuted: true) and does not execute against
  a live database. A Zenodo snapshot may be public while the GitHub source
  repository remains private. Packages are not published to PyPI or npm.
keywords:
  - RQL
  - RAG
